es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","review_id":"7oH6pmD9oVDxbBwxx5-aLg","date":"2021-05-05T18:03:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9309060573577881,"text_excerpt":"Fantastic spot and atmosphere! I recommend trying it out! Look up the meaning of the name if you are unfamiliar with Mexican Folklore. The tacos were just okay. Authenticity is probably there, but, I wanted more flavor. Queso was yummy. Drinks were good. Margaritas were awesome."},{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","review_id":"XCysGjU3NCJWMbeMPdXLgQ","date":"2020-11-19T21:42:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9223420023918152,"text_excerpt":"It's a little unfortunate that they are so new and didn't have a happy hour yet but I would definitely go back. They have a lovely outdoor area. It's huuuge with umbrellas. The setting is comfortable with a fun whole wall mural. The food was great. We got the taco plate, the queso with chorizo and their campechana de mariscos. I'll go back. Their margaritas were small, light on alcohol and mostly ice."},{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","review_id":"ADhuL9umIgP_ebijNN7apA","date":"2021-02-01T04:10:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9215323328971863,"text_excerpt":"First time trying El Cucuy and was not disappointed! They offer out door seating and all tables are social distant form the next. We started with chips, salsa, guacamole and queso. I had the Birria taco special, 2 tacos with pickled onions and of course the stew to dip. I can't wait to come back and try more!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","photo_id":"X-TequN8Bja73qtjTJewFw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/X-TequN8Bja73qtjTJewFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.903407871723175},{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","photo_id":"0i34nvOCl5n_OUl9bYlNcA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0i34nvOCl5n_OUl9bYlNcA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8891580700874329},{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","photo_id":"VOoBVFH3E0bJCwNqrHOQ0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VOoBVFH3E0bJCwNqrHOQ0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8782455325126648},{"business_id":"54PNfAT0kCG3JLgGOojc4A","photo_id":"6Nuu9ecyVM7wr9PwlFCtDg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/6Nuu9ecyVM7wr9PwlFCtDg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.874964714050293}]},"notebook_case":null}
